---
import coverImage from "@/assets/cover.jpg";
import Figure from "@/components/Figure.astro";

type navLink = {
  id: string;
  label: string;
}

interface Props {
  nav: navLink[];
}

const { nav } = Astro.props;
---

<header class="header">
  <div class="top">
    <h1>Jaime Hernández <span class="subtitle">Cognitive Designer · Web Developer since 2014</span></h1>
    <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:contact@jaime.one">Contact</a>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <nav class="col-6" aria-labelledby="nav-label">
      <p id="nav-label" class="nav-label small-caps">Navigate to:</p>
      <ul class="toc">
        {nav.map((s, i) => <li><a href={`#${s.id}`}>
          <span class="index">{i + 1}</span>&nbsp;{s.label}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="col-6">
      <p>I build and organize systems according to the capacities of the <em>human</em> mind.</p>

      <p>In web development, I specialize in maintaining and simplifying entire codebases and design systems, whether for clients or for open-source projects, regardless of the tools and languages involved. Outside web development, I create and modify software that makes my own work more effective. I also typeset books to make them easier to read.</p>

      <p>My work spans both design and implementation. Everything should be clear, with nothing extra and nothing missing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="figure">
    <Figure src={coverImage} alt="Drawing of my electronics lab" ratio="3 / 2" eager class="lab">
      My lab, where I build and explore physical systems. Electronics and electrical work are unforgiving, and potentially lethal, during development, so you learn to understand a system before you power it up. I try to bring the same discipline to software, where a lack of understanding can stay hidden while more code is built on top of it, like a house on sand.
    </Figure>
  </div>
</header>


<style>
.header {
  margin-top: var(--space-xl);
}

.top {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
}

.contact-link {
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-top: 1em;
}

@media (max-width: 500px) {
  .contact-link {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
}

.toc {
  list-style: none;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);

  a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
}

.nav-label {
  margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.figure {
  margin-top: var(--space-xl);
}
</style>
